# Nintendo 3DS port.
#
# The ignore list at the top of the repository is written for the autotools
# build that lives there, and several of its rules are wrong here: a bare
# "Makefile" is generated at the root but hand written in this directory, and
# the vendored dependencies below carry Makefile.am, Makefile.in and other
# names that list expects to be build output. Start from a clean slate and
# then ignore only what this build actually produces.
!*

# Built by platform/3ds/Makefile.
build/
build-full/
*.3dsx
*.cia
*.elf
*.smdh
*.map
*.log

# Assembled from the repository's own data by prepare-romfs.
romfs/

# Written by protoc from src/protobuf.
generated/

# Cross build trees for the vendored dependencies, made by
# build-dependencies.sh. The hand written ftgl makefile is not one of them.
vendor/*-build-3ds/
!vendor/ftgl-build-3ds/
vendor/ftgl-build-3ds/*
!vendor/ftgl-build-3ds/Makefile
